sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Controller
  participant P as CGLIB proxy of TicketService
  participant TM as TenantAwareJpaTransactionManager
  participant S as Target TicketService
  participant DB as Database
  C->>P: transition(id, request)
  P->>TM: getTransaction (REQUIRED)
  TM->>DB: begin, enable tenantFilter, set_config app.tenant_id
  TM-->>P: transaction status
  P->>S: invoke real method
  S->>S: this.helper() - direct call, NO proxy, NO new transaction
  S->>DB: load, mutate, save
  S-->>P: result or RuntimeException
  alt RuntimeException or Error
    P->>TM: rollback
  else normal return
    P->>TM: commit, then afterCommit hooks
  end
  P-->>C: result
